cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "mathhist-toolkit: evidence tags and a graph ontology for the history of mathematics"
abstract: >-
  mathhist-toolkit provides two layers for writing the history of mathematics:
  an evidence-tagging specification with a linter (mathlint), and a
  graph-structured ontology with a validator (graphlint). Code is licensed
  under Apache-2.0; documentation and specification texts are licensed under
  CC BY 4.0. See LICENSE and LICENSE-docs.
